  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods and Capacity Building Project to improve reintegration initiatives for ex-offenders and parolees through a pilot integrated livelihoods and life skills programme.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Livelihoods and Capacity Building Project to improve reintegration initiatives for ex-offenders and parolees through a pilot integrated livelihoods and life skills programme. is a component of Jamaica Strategic Corrections Partnership Project  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;384,533. It works in the following sector(s): Security system management and reform, Employment creation, Basic life skills for adults.</narrative>
  </description>
